# Learnings — logs-timeline-calendar

## 프로젝트 컨벤션
- React Router 7 (Vite) + Cloudflare D1 + Drizzle ORM
- Tailwind CSS v4 (Quiet Depth 디자인 토큰)
- 모든 UI 텍스트 한국어, 코드(변수/함수/타입)는 영어
- `cn()` 유틸리티로 클래스 병합
- `~/lib/motion/motion` 래퍼 사용 (framer-motion 직접 import 금지)
- Link: `~/components/content/SmartLink` 또는 `@react-router/dom`의 Link
- 워크트리: /Users/hellosunghyun/Documents/Github/divelog-timeline
- 브랜치: feature/logs-timeline-calendar

## 주요 파일 위치
- 기록 목록: app/routes/public/logs/index.tsx (332줄)
- 기존 TimelineView: app/components/views/TimelineView.tsx (91줄, 날짜 기반)
- 기존 ViewToggle: app/components/views/ViewToggle.tsx (82줄, 2-way)
- SceneCard: app/components/cards/SceneCard.tsx (163줄, stageToneClasses L45-50)
- FilterBar: app/components/filters/FilterBar.tsx
- SortBar: app/components/filters/SortBar.tsx
- date-groups: app/lib/utils/date-groups.ts (130줄) — 수정 금지
- 기존 Radix 래퍼: app/components/ui/dialog.tsx — 패턴 참고

## 스키마 핵심
- records.format: "note" | "article"
- records.stageId: FK to stages.id (NULLABLE)
- records.createdAt: unix epoch (seconds)
- stages.order: integer (정렬 기준)
- stages.type: "prelude" | "bridge" | "challenge" | "epilogue"

## Stage 톤 매핑 (SceneCard.tsx:45-50)
- prelude → mist-blue
- bridge → reef-cyan
- challenge → deep-ocean
- epilogue → neutral

## Task 2: @radix-ui/react-popover Installation
- Installed: `@radix-ui/react-popover@^1.1.15` (matches dialog version)
- Commit: `ee62b04` — "chore: add @radix-ui/react-popover"
- No new typecheck errors introduced
- Ready for popover-based UI components (e.g., calendar picker, dropdown menus)

## Task 4: Calendar Utilities
- Added `app/lib/utils/calendar.ts` with Sunday-start month grid generation, month-scoped record grouping, and Korean month label formatting
- `getRecordsForMonth()` follows existing epoch-seconds -> local `Date` conversion pattern from `date-groups.ts` via `new Date(record.createdAt * 1000)`
- Added `app/lib/utils/__tests__/calendar.test.ts` with 8 Vitest cases covering 31-day months, regular/leap February, Sunday padding, empty record groups, and month label formatting

## Task 5: Radix Popover 래퍼 컴포넌트
- Created `app/components/ui/popover.tsx` following dialog.tsx pattern
- Exports: `Popover`, `PopoverTrigger`, `PopoverAnchor`, `PopoverContent`
- PopoverContent: forwardRef with Quiet Depth styling (bg-surface, border-border, rounded-xl, shadow-tinted-sm, z-50, p-4)
- Animation states: data-[state=open]:animate-in/fade-in-0/zoom-in-95, data-[state=closed]:animate-out/fade-out-0/zoom-out-95
- Portal rendering via PopoverPrimitive.Portal
- Default props: align="center", sideOffset=4
- Commit: `b886e01` — "feat(ui): Radix Popover 래퍼 컴포넌트"
- No new typecheck errors (pre-existing 35 errors unchanged)

